     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><div xml:lang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : CarteDeConcepts FRLegalAuthenticationLMCDAFHIR</b></p><a name=\"FRLegalAuthenticationLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><a name=\"hcFRLegalAuthenticationLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p><b>Groupe 1 </b>Mapping de <a href=\"StructureDefinition-FRLMLegalAuthentication.html\">Logical model - FR LM Legal Authentication</a> to <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-legal-authenticator.html\">CDA - legalAuthenticator</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Code source</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>relation</b></td><td><b>Code cible</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Commentaire</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-FRLMLegalAuthentication.html#s-FRLMLegalAuthentication\">FRLMLegalAuthentication</a></td><td>1..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-legal-authenticator.html#s-LegalAuthenticator\">LegalAuthenticator</a></td><td>1..1</td><td>todo</td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-FRLMLegalAuthentication.html#s-FRLMLegalAuthentication.dateTime\">FRLMLegalAuthentication.dateTime</a></td><td>1..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-legal-authenticator.html#s-LegalAuthenticator.time\">LegalAuthenticator.time</a></td><td>1..1</td><td>todo</td><td/></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMLegalAuthentication.legalAuthenticator:healthProfessional</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-legal-authenticator.html#s-LegalAuthenticator.assignedEntity\">LegalAuthenticator.assignedEntity</a></td><td>1..1</td><td>todo</td><td>Le responsable professionnel de santé est de type FRLMHealthProfessional, cf. FRHealthProfessionalLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMLegalAuthentication.legalAuthenticator:patient</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-legal-authenticator.html#s-LegalAuthenticator.assignedEntity\">LegalAuthenticator.assignedEntity</a></td><td>1..1</td><td>todo</td><td>Le responsable patient/usager (document d'expression personnelle) est de type FRLMPatient, cf. FRPatientLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMLegalAuthentication.legalAuthenticator:device</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-legal-authenticator.html#s-LegalAuthenticator.assignedEntity\">LegalAuthenticator.assignedEntity</a></td><td>1..1</td><td>todo</td><td>Le responsable système est de type FRLMDevice, cf. FRDeviceLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMLegalAuthentication.legalAuthenticator:organisation</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-legal-authenticator.html#s-