uivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">Composition.attester.party.PractitionerRole</td><td>attester.party.resolve().ofType(PractitionerRole) — cf. FRHealthProfessionalLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMLegalAuthentication.legalAuthenticator:patient</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">Composition.attester.party.Patient</td><td>attester.party.resolve().ofType(Patient) — cf. FRPatientLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMLegalAuthentication.legalAuthenticator:device</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">Composition.attester.party.Device</td><td>attester.party.resolve().ofType(Device) — cf. FRDeviceLMCDAFHIR (composant commun).</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMLegalAuthentication.legalAuthenticator:organisation</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">Composition.attester.party.Organization</td><td>attester.party.resolve().ofType(Organization) — cf. FROrganisationLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ConceptMap FRLegalAuthenticationLMCDAFHIR</b></p><a name=\"en-FRLegalAuthenticationLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><a name=\"en-hcFRLegalAuthenticationLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p><b>Group 1 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"StructureDefinition-FRLMLegalAuthentication.html\">Logical model - FR LM Legal Authentication</a> to <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-legal-authenticator.html\">CDA - legalAuthenticator</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Sou